tese player of similar age to Miles played him in one of the two 12-player all-play-alls which Miles took part in Malta in the summer of 1973. I'm making the assumption that it was the second and stronger of the two tournaments Miles played in Malta in 1973 though it could have been the first. JS [%eval #-3] } 0-1

